(
    title: "Venture",
    description: Some("Winky is a dot in the corridors and a grinning face inside the chambers, stealing one treasure from each room of the dungeon with a bow. Arrows do nothing to the Hallmonsters patrolling outside, and a monster\'s corpse kills on contact just as the living one does — so shooting only pays once the treasure is already yours."),
